{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["ROAD TO YOU","Commercials by Dunlop Tyres Japan for their Winter Maxx tire line.\n\n\n\nEpisode 1 (Kimi e to Tsuzuku Michi) (The Road That Goes On to You): The anime short's story is set in a certain snowy land and centers on the intermingling feelings of three groups of men and women: a couple, a parent and child, and coworkers.\n\n\n\nEpisode 2 (Hoshifuruoka no Yakusoku) (Promise of the Starry Hill): College student Yui was suddenly invited by her mother to visit an observatory on her 20th birthday. Yui has to travel along snow-covered roads to reach the observatory. The visit makes Yui remember going to the same observatory with her late father on every birthday when she was a small child.\n\n\n\nEpisode 3 (Kioku ni Mau Konayuki) (The Snow that Dances in Memories)\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ROAD TO YOU",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-36492","ids":{"shikimori":36492,"mal":36492,"anilist":100211,"kodik":"serial-62688"},"kodikIds":["movie-20579","movie-49003","serial-59958","serial-62688"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-20579":"2019-11-14T20:03:39Z","movie-49003":"2020-02-06T20:29:50Z","serial-59958":"2024-06-21T15:29:53Z","serial-62688":"2024-10-15T01:21:33Z"},"title":"Дорога к тебе","originalTitle":"Road to You: Kimi e to Tsuzuku Michi","alt":"Road to You: Hoshifuru Oka no Yakusoku / Road to You: Kioku ni Mau Konayuki / Road to You: Promise of the Starry Hill / Road to You: The Road That Goes on to You / Road to You: The Snow That Dances in Memories ROAD TO YOU","description":"Действие разворачивается в заснеженной местности и касается взаимоотношений трёх различных групп, состоящих из мужчин и женщин. Первая — пара влюблённых, вторая — ребёнок и его родитель, третья — товарищи по работе.","year":2017,"type":"ONA","genres":["Драма","Романтика"],"rating":6.54,"popularity":4572,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/36492/9